 of Maintenance Free Operations<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-15fb962 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"15fb962\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-a73a4c9\" data-id=\"a73a4c9\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3c60951 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3c60951\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>In our ever changing and highly demanding industry, drilling companies need products to not only be innovative but also surpass quality. WOM understands that product repairs and maintenance are necessary but maximizing the efficiency and longevity of the products are important to reduce both time and costs. Our client recommendation letter from Abraj Energy Services, Oman signifies just that and our continued innovation being put to test and succeeding.<\/p><p>Abraj Energy Services, Oman purchased 4-1\/16\u2019 10K Drilling Choke Manifolds in two separate projects in 2014 and 2015 that were used by Abraj on their Land Rigs for their operations in the BP Khazzan Tight gas Field and PDO(Petroleum Development Oman) which is the National Oil and gas Company of Oman respectively. After 5 years in service for each; the WOM recertification of these manifolds and the minimal cost of spare parts wasn&#8217;t even 10% of equi